  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "There's thousands of fake accounts squatting names on VRC and have been for years a couple changes can help fix that \n\n-Visitors squatters should have their name unlinked if they inactive for 1 month, if they're not new user, its very likely they were made just to squat on the name \n\n-banned users, specifically throwaways banned, are squatting on the name. They need to be released from that limbo, they're trapped until they're wiped\n\n\n\n*Trusted users are safe from this because they're already established",
